OL,3,AUK budget leaves NI underfunded, O'Dowd
OL,4,Asays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Secretary of State Chris Bryant has
OL,7,Foffered #1.5bn over the next three
OL,8,Fyears and said if Stormont ministers
OL,9,Faccept this, that will take funding
OL,10,Fcomfortably above the level of need.
